  "mongodb-compact": "Fakasiʻisiʻi ʻo e MongoDB",
  "mongodb-compact-description": "Hili hono hiki ʻo e ngaahi faile mei he MongoDB GridFS, ʻoku ʻikai siʻisiʻi fakaʻatamai ʻa e faile tauhiʻanga fakamatala ʻi he tisi. ʻOku toe maʻu mai ʻe he Fakasiʻisiʻi ʻa e vahaʻa ataʻatā ʻaki hono toe tohi ʻo e fakamatala ʻo e tānaki. Fai pē eni hili hono ʻosi ʻo e hiki faile lahi.",
  "mongodb-compact-warning": "Fakatokanga: Ko e Fakasiʻisiʻi ko ha ngāue ʻoku ne taʻofi ʻa e ngaahi ngāue kehe pea ʻe ala fuoloa ha ngaahi miniti ʻi ha ngaahi tauhiʻanga fakamatala lahi. ʻI he ngaahi replica set, ʻoku ʻuluaki fakasiʻisiʻi (fakaʻatamai) ʻa e ngaahi secondary kotoa, pea toki fai ʻa e primary. ʻI he ngaahi replica set node ʻe taha ʻoku ngāueʻaki ki he oplog (fokotuʻutuʻu Meteor angamaheni), ʻoku fakasiʻisiʻi pē ʻa e primary.",
  "mongodb-compact-run": "Fai ʻa e Fakasiʻisiʻi ʻo e MongoDB",
