  "password-length-first-login": "Hū ki loto ʻuluaki",
  "password-length-fixed": "Kuo fakatonutonu",
  "password-length-from-environment": "ʻOku ngāue ha mahuʻinga naʻe fokotuʻu ʻi he ʻātakai ʻo e sēvea; ko hono tauhi heni ʻoku ne fetongi ia.",
  "password-length-last-login": "Hū ki loto fakamuimui",
  "password-length-login-count": "Tuʻo lahi naʻe hū ki loto",
  "password-length-no-results": "ʻOku ʻikai ha ʻakauni heni.",
  "password-length-report-desc": "Ngaahi ʻakauni naʻe hū ki loto ʻaki ha lea fufū ʻoku nounou ange ʻi he lōloa siʻisiʻi taha. Ko e palausa pē ʻoku ʻiloʻi ʻa e lōloa ʻo ha lea fufū, ko ia ʻoku ne lipooti ha lea fufū nounou hili hono hū ki loto; ʻoku ʻikai teitei mavahe ʻa e lea fufū mo hono lōloa mei ai. Ko e Kuo fakatonutonu ko e taimi naʻe liliu ai ʻa e lea fufū ʻo e ʻakauni - ko ha ʻakauni ʻoku toe hū ki loto ʻaki ha lea fufū nounou ʻoku toe fakahaaʻi ia ʻoku nounou fau.",
  "password-length-saved": "Kuo tauhi.",
  "password-min-length": "Lōloa siʻisiʻi taha ʻo e lea fufū",
  "password-min-length-description": "Ko e hū ki loto ʻaki ha lea fufū nounou ange ʻoku lisi ʻi lalo. ʻOku ʻikai teitei fakafisingaʻi ʻa e hū ki loto koeʻuhi ko ia.",
  "password-min-length-enforce": "Fakamālohiʻi ʻa e lōloa siʻisiʻi taha",
  "password-min-length-enforce-description": "ʻOku fakafisingaʻi ha lea fufū foʻou ʻoku nounou ange, pea ko ha ʻakauni ʻoku hū ki loto ʻaki ha lea fufū nounou ange kuo pau ke ne liliu ia ki muʻa ʻi ha toe meʻa. Ko hono liliu ʻoku ne mavahe ai ʻa e ngaahi seseni kotoa ʻo e ʻakauni. Ko e ngaahi lea fufū ʻa LDAP, OAuth2, OIDC, SAML, CAS mo Sandstorm ʻoku ʻa honau tokotaha ʻoatu, pea ʻoku ʻikai siviʻi.",
  "password-change-required-text": "ʻOku fiemaʻu ʻe he uepisaiti ni ʻi he taimi ni ha ngaahi lea fufū ʻoku ʻi ai ha mataʻitohi ʻe __min__ pe lahi ange, pea ʻoku nounou ange hoʻo meʻa. Fili ha meʻa ʻoku lōloa ange ke hoko atu. Hili ia ʻe mavahe ʻa e ngaahi seseni kotoa ʻo hoʻo ʻakauni, pea te ke toe hū ki loto ʻaki ʻa e lea fufū foʻou.",
  "date-format-for-everyone": "Founga ʻo e ʻahó maʻá e tokotaha kotoa",
  "calendar-system": "tohi māhina",
  "show-unread-changes": "Fakaʻilongaʻi ʻa e ngaahi kaati kuo liliu talu mei he taimi naʻá ku fakaava fakamuimui ai",
  "show-unread-changes-desc": "Ko ha kaati ʻoku liliu hono kaveinga, fakamatala, ngaahi ʻaho, ngaahi fakaʻilonga, kau mēmipa, ngaahi lisi sivi, ngaahi meʻa fakapipiki pe ngaahi fakamatala hili hoʻo fakaava fakamuimui ia, ʻe maʻu ha kapa lanu pulū ʻi hono kaati siʻi, kae ʻoua kuó ke fakaava ia.",
  "keep-title-tags": "Tauhi ʻa e #fakaʻilonga mo e @mēmipa ʻi he ngaahi kaveinga ʻo e kaati foʻou",
  "keep-title-tags-description": "ʻI hoʻo fili ha fakaʻilonga ʻaki ʻa e # pe ha mēmipa ʻaki ʻa e @ lolotonga hoʻo tohi ʻa e kaveinga ʻo ha kaati foʻou, tauhi ʻa e konga tohi ko iá ʻi he kaveinga foki. Tāmateʻi: ʻoku fetongi ʻa e konga tohi ʻaki ʻa e fakaʻilonga pe mēmipa.",
  "show-focus-outline": "Fakahaaʻi ʻa e laine ʻo e tokanga",
  "keep-add-card-form-open": "Tauhi ke ava ʻa e foomu Tānaki ha kaati hili hono tānaki ha kaati",
  "keep-add-card-form-open-description": "Ava: hili hono tānaki ha kaati, ʻoku nofo ava pē ʻa e foomu mo ha hingoa ʻataʻatā ki he kaati hoko. Tāpuni: ʻoku tāpuni ʻa e foomu ʻi he taimi kuo tānaki ai ʻa e kaati.",
  "title-bracket-label": "Liliu ʻa e [fakaʻilonga] ʻi he kamataʻanga ʻo e kaveinga ʻo ha kaati foʻou ko ha fakaʻilonga",
  "title-bracket-label-description": "ʻI he taimi ʻoku kamata ai ʻa e kaveinga ʻo ha kaati foʻou ʻaki ʻa e [Konga tohi] pea muimui ai ha konga tohi kehe, ʻoku hoko ʻa e Konga tohi ko ha fakaʻilonga ʻo e kaati (ʻoku faʻu ia kapau ʻoku ʻikai ha fakaʻilonga ʻi he papa ʻoku pehē hono hingoa) pea toʻo ia mei he kaveinga. Tāmateʻi: ʻoku tauhi ʻa e kaveinga ʻo hangē ko ia ʻoku ʻi ai.",
  "submit-on-enter": "ʻAve ʻa e ngaahi feituʻu fakatonutonu ʻaki ʻa e Enter",
  "submit-on-enter-description": "ʻI he taimi ʻoku fakaʻatā ai, ko hono lomiʻi ʻa e Enter ʻoku tauhi ai ʻa e kaveinga, fakamatala mo e ngaahi feituʻu fakatonutonu kehe ʻo e kaati; ʻoku tānaki ʻe he Shift+Enter ha laine foʻou. ʻI he taimi ʻoku taʻofi ai, ʻoku tauhi ʻe he Ctrl/Cmd+Enter pea tānaki ʻe he Enter ha laine foʻou.",
  "open-many-cards-at-once": "Fakaava ha ngaahi kaati lahi ʻi he taimi tatau",
  "open-many-cards-at-once-description": "Tauhi ke ava ʻa e kaati kotoa pē ʻoku ke lomiʻi ʻi hono matapā sioʻata pē ʻoʻona. ʻI he taimi ʻoku tāmateʻi ai ʻa e meʻa ni, ko hono lomiʻi ha kaati ʻoku tāpuni ai ʻa e kaati naʻe ava.",
  "checklist-ding-sound": "Fakatangi ha leʻo ʻi he taimi ʻoku fakaʻosi ai ha fāsili checklist",
  "checklist-ding-sound-description": "ʻOku fakatangi ha leʻo nounou ʻi hoʻo fakaʻilongaʻi ha fāsili checklist. Kuo tāmateʻi ʻi he founga makehe.",
